        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. The overtime provisions of Article VIII, Section 3, Paragraph 98, of the Agreement that refer to premium pay for work performed in excess of eight hours in any one workday are waived for all full-time employees working a 4 x 10 Schedule.",
